<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區（寫出完整過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>化簡：3a + 5a = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>化簡：7b − 2b = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>當 x = 3 時，求 2x + 5 的值。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
